WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.444
I go to the barbershop.

2
00:00:03.445 --> 00:00:07.199
I get a haircut.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.642
I go to the post office.

4
00:00:09.643 --> 00:00:14.177
I mail my letters.

5
00:00:14.178 --> 00:00:17.020
I go to the fire station.

6
00:00:17.021 --> 00:00:21.431
I learn about safety.

7
00:00:21.432 --> 00:00:24.770
I go to the library.

8
00:00:24.771 --> 00:00:29.234
I borrow books.

9
00:00:29.235 --> 00:00:31.970
I go to the bakery.

10
00:00:31.971 --> 00:00:36.136
I buy some bread.

11
00:00:36.137 --> 00:00:38.875
I go to the grocery store.

12
00:00:38.876 --> 00:00:44.282
I buy some fruits and vegetables.

13
00:00:44.283 --> 00:00:46.766
I go to the pet store.

14
00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:52.409
I buy some dog food.

15
00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:58.021
"Whew! What a busy day!"

